        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_090\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_090"
    },
    {
        "id": 136,
        "raw": "[name=\"慌てたオペレーター\"] い……一体、上で何が起きているんだ？",
